      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Putting multiple feature requests into one post is great for purposes of reading once. But for actual discussion and implentation consideration it's recommended to do one feature request at a time.\n\nBut if we're just throwing stuff out there, I want a clock :)\n\nThe third one sounds interesting, make sure it's titled properly when you submit it by itself. \n\nFor desktop streaming camera how is it supposed to function? Would VRChat create a second game window just for stream camera output?\n\nBadges? I also for see a bunch of discussion",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
