  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-07-23T05:28:59.902Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Desktop streaming camera\n\n2. Let worlds give out little badges for doing stuff in them that you can show on your profile.\n\nFor example: winning as a guard in prison break\n\n3. Kinda a stretch but a sensory/shy mode where you can temporarily go invisible, hiding your name tag and avatar, as well as muting your mic so you can get to a quieter part of the world, this would be toggle able by world creators to prevent game world cheating. You could also as a play set it if you still wanna be able to see and hear other players, or set it so groups of people (friends/specific users) can still hear and see you, so you can interact with your friends still while hiding from the rest of the lobby. I know it's very much a stretch, but honestly as a very shy person, I would like a way to completely hide myself from the server with the exception of a few select people I really trust.",
